      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-002.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "Gamma的创始人格兰特做咨询时,曾为第二天的会议熬夜准备。",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 5054.829931972789
        },
        {
          "text": "他说,大量工夫花在排版,内容反而顾不上。",
          "startMs": 5155,
          "endMs": 8178.083900226758
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:word"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-003",
      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-003.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "他找来两位老同事,想把顺序倒过来:先把话写清楚,再让工具处理版式。",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 5159.319727891157
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:word"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-004",
      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-004.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "Gamma后来接入AI,让文字先变成配好图文的初稿。",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 3487.4829931972786
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:word"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-005",
      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-005.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "有了初稿,还能让AI改布局,把文字变成图示。",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 3452.6530612244896
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:word"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-006",
      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-006.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "他们拿下了Product Hunt月榜第一,增长却还是卡住了。",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 4195.691609977324
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:word"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-007",
      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-007.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "于是,十二个人花了三个月,重做用户进来的前三十秒。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 3814.2006802721085
        },
        {
          "text": "他们把AI生成直接放进新手流程:输入一句想法,先得到一份有内容、有版式的PPT。",
          "startMs": 3918.75,
          "endMs": 10804.757180650036
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-010",
      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-010.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "用户面对的不再是空白页,而是一份能接着修改的初稿,第一次用就看得见它的价值。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 6039.446334089192
        },
        {
          "text": "按创始人的回顾,日注册量随后从几百,涨到了几万。",
          "startMs": 6243.75,
          "endMs": 10505.418556311413
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-008",
      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-008.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "二零二五年十一月,Gamma自报年化经常性收入突破一亿美元。",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 4160.861678004536
        },
        {
          "text": "到二零二六年八月,公司披露累计用户已超一亿。",
          "startMs": 4261,
          "endMs": 7852.972789115646
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:word"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-009",
      "file": "episodes/episode-011/audio/seg-009.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "做PPT,不必再从空白页一页页排起。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 2698.0045351473923
